  "visualBrief": "The concrete figure turns toward her outstretched left hand, raising a long sword with her right. The modeled folds of the windblown robe and sash carry the forward stride down to the two bare feet and the low summit plinth.",
  "heightPolicy": "The summit datum is 113 m above sea level in standard Terrarium. The foundation is embedded and the short apron blends from the low exposed plinth into the sampled slope. The native terrain and mapped paths remain in place.",
  "nativeAxes": "+Z east-southeast across the plinth toward the main memorial approach, +X north-northeast along the plinth front, +Y up.",
  "limitations": [
    "The model uses the published 85 m sculpture height including the sword and a roughly 2 m exposed plinth. The figure proportions, hand pose, folds and sword openings are reconstructed from photographs.",
    "The named map point and mapped plinth fix placement. The geotagged hilltop view confirms the signed east-southeast face. Standard Terrarium supplies the summit datum and the apron grades.",
    "The compact apron transitions to coarse surrounding terrain and leaves the mapped paths in place. The rest of the memorial complex is outside this asset."
  ],
